OL,3,GNEWSAPolice refer 'fail to stop' bike
OL,4,Acrash to watchdog
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn incident in which two teenagers on a
OL,7,Fmotorbike, suspected to have been
OL,8,Fstolen, failed to stop for police and
OL,9,Fcollided with a car has been referred
OL,10,Fto the police watchdog.
OL,12,FThe rider, 17, suffered a serious leg
OL,13,Finjury and remains in hospital after
OL,14,Fthe crash on Wednesday afternoon at the
OL,15,Fjunction of Moorside Road and Harrogate
OL,16,FRoad in Bradford.
OL,18,FHis passenger, also 17, suffered minor
OL,19,Finjuries and was treated in hospital.
OL,20,FBoth were arrested for a number of
OL,21,Falleged offences.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,383,380,200,160,0,100
